DATA NOTICE

This licence covers the source code in this repository only.

Ball-by-ball data produced by the pipeline originates from Cricsheet
(https://cricsheet.org) and is licensed CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Any deployment that uses it must
credit Cricsheet. The generated About page does so automatically.

Player metadata and rankings optionally retrieved from ESPNcricinfo and the ICC
remain subject to those sites' own terms of use. Neither is used unless
explicitly enabled.

The bundled demo dataset in web/data is simulated. Every player, team and venue
in it is fictional.
